# Typed Error Handling

- Keep controllers thin: request in, response out, business logic elsewhere.
- In services, throw typed errors from `src/utils/service-error.ts` instead of ad hoc error objects.
- Do not invent one-off error response formats in feature code.
- Let the shared error-handling path map service errors to HTTP responses consistently.
